Now part 2 replacing marker. Methods: updateAI, updateProgress, updatePosition, updateCamera, updateParticles, onCrash, finishRace, loadBest, saveBest, render, plus maybe format helpers.

UpdateAI:
```
updateAI(dt, menu) {
 const L = track.length;
 for ai:
   const lane = ai.laneOffset + sin(progress*.017+seed)*1.9;
   const ahead = track.pointAtDistance(progress+26);
   const p = track.lanePoint(progress,lane);
   const dot = clamp(p.tx*ahead.tx + p.ty*ahead.ty, -1,1);
   const curve = (1-dot); // 0 straight, up to 2
   let target = ai.base - curve*30; // 56-60 -> 30 at hairpin
   if (menu) target = ai.base*0.62;
   ai.speed = damp(ai.speed, target, 2.4, dt)
   ai.progress += ai.speed*dt
   if(menu) ai.progress = mod? track.pointAtDistance handles normalize, but progress grows unbounded; laneOffset uses sin of huge; okay. position funcs use progress for minimap? mini only positions. For menu can wrap to keep progress small: if(progress>L) progress-=L.
   placeAI(ai, ai.progress)
   // compute steer from curvature:
   ai.steer = clamp((p.tx*ahead.ty - p.ty*ahead.tx)*14, -1, 1)
   ai.vx=cos(angle)*speed...
   ai.boosting=false
   ai.speed...
```
Need placeAI after progress update, lane computed inside with sin. Order: compute p via lane; update speed; update progress; placeAI. Use ahead before? fine.

`ai.speed` target should be based on curvature at current progress. If base 56 and corner slow 30. Good. Menu speed base*0.62 ~35.

AI starting progress: player at start 0; AI 9/17/25 m ahead. In 1st frame they move. Good.
Position player 4.

`updateProgress`:
```
const L=this.track.length;
const near=this.player.near || track.nearest;
let delta=shortestDelta(this.prevS, near.s, L);
if (Math.abs(delta)>28) delta=0;
this.total += delta;
this.prevS=near.s;
if (this.total < -5) this.total=-5? maybe allow. Keep.
let target = this.lapIndex*L + ((this.nextGate+1)/8)*L;
if (this.total >= target) {
 if(this.nextGate<7){ ... } else { ... lap complete ...}
}
this.lap=Math.min(3,this.lapIndex+1)
```
Potential issue player near line at start, nearest index 0 s=0; delta 0. Good.
But `updateProgress` is called after updateAI and before updateParticles; near from player update. good.

Gate pass increment and effect:
```
this.nextGate +=1
this.nitro=min(100,nitro+5)
this.score += 100*this.multiplier
hud.toast(`GATE 0${this.nextGate}`)
