```
For smoke rising z can go high. okay.

`onCrash(force)`:
```
if(this.state!=='race') return;
this.crashCooldown=this.crashCooldown>0?this.crashCooldown:0.65; 
this.camera.shake=Math.min(1,0.35+force/55)
